## Why this exists

HydraHunt is published as a portfolio piece and as a starting point for other
people's own job-search tooling. You are welcome to read it, learn from it, fork
it and adapt it. It is not a product, and it is not offered for sale.

## Definitions

**"the Work"** — this repository and everything in it: source code,
configuration, documentation and assets.

**"Commercial Use"** — any use of the Work, or of any part or derivative of it,
intended to derive commercial advantage or monetary compensation. That includes,
without limitation:

- selling, licensing or sublicensing the Work, in original or modified form
- incorporating the Work into a product or service offered to third parties for
  a fee or on a subscription
- using the Work to deliver paid work, including paid consulting or contract
  services built on it
- operating a hosted or managed service whose value derives from the Work

Personal use, study, evaluation, and unpaid hobby or portfolio projects are **not**
Commercial Use.

